units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region unitcell block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 unitcell
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
run_style verlet
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 600.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal vol density
thermo_modify flush yes
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 220000
